  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> is the density and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi></math> is coefficient of viscosity of fluid which flows with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> in the pipe of diameter <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>, the correct formula for Reynolds number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></math> is"
  },
